# Opinion

Meeting: 0009-design-web-client-architecture
Agent: Developer
Task: design web client architecture
Context:
- Implementation needs to stay small and dependency-free while being testable via Node.
- The controller should assume only basic DOM APIs and form submissions.
Position:
- Create calendar_model.mjs with normalization helpers, deterministic palette, and agenda/insight utilities.
- Build ui_templates.mjs as a pure string renderer; avoid coupling to document APIs.
Recommendations:
- Let app.js focus on wiring: seed data, attach listeners, sync selects, and push status messages.
- Store ISO strings in the model; use datetime-local inputs for UX friendliness.
- Ensure every mutation goes through the model so tests can assert state and storage calls.
